      "content": "wow, that's intense. he's really doubling down on the point. keep going with it. finish that sentence and keep going—he should explain why the \"experts\" who defend these alliances are actually just part of the problem or even traitors to the working class. make it feel like his frustration is totally justified based on what he sees happening in the country.",
